			'content'   => '<div class="page-title" style="color:#000000;line-height:21.42px;box-sizing:border-box;"><h1 style="box-sizing:border-box;">Etick&aacute; komise - př&iacute;loha č. 1 jednac&iacute;ho ř&aacute;du</h1></div><div class="page-content" style="color:#000000;line-height:21.42px;box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong>Etick&aacute; komise KOLF s.r.o.</strong></p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">Masarykovo n&aacute;m. 2667 , 530 02 Pardubice</p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">Tel./fax : 46 6753 228 , 46 6535 704</p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong>Jm&eacute;no , Profese , Pracovi&scaron;tě</strong></p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong>MUDr. Josef Erben</strong></p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">předseda EK &nbsp;; &nbsp;l&eacute;kař	NZZ v oboru &nbsp;interna, gastroenterolgie</p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong>MUDr. </strong><strong>Valeri&aacute;n Pan&aacute;ček</strong></p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">m&iacute;stopředseda EK &nbsp;; &nbsp;l&eacute;kař	NZZ v oboru praktick&yacute; l&eacute;kař pro dospěl&eacute;</p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong>MUDr. Erben Petr</strong></p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">člen EK &nbsp;; &nbsp;l&eacute;kař	NZZ v oboru ortopedie</p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong>MUDr. V&aacute;clav V&aacute;vra</strong></p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">člen EK &nbsp;; &nbsp;l&eacute;kař	NZZ v oboru ortopedie</p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong>MUDr. Olga Hudcov&aacute;</strong></p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">člen EK &nbsp;; &nbsp;l&eacute;kařka Nemocnice Pardubick&eacute;ho kraje a.s. v oboru alergolog-imunolog</p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong>Mgr.&nbsp;Salfick&aacute; Olga</strong></p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">člen EK &nbsp;;&nbsp;&nbsp;referent oblasti zdravotn&iacute; politiky KOLF s.r.o.</p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">Datum: 1.1.2020</p></div>',
